        195.79736328125,
        505.74249267578125,
        204.70391845703125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In addition, Nie et al. [27] introduces unsupervised classifier-free guidance (CFG), a plug-and-play",
      "bbox": [
        108.0,
        212.18536376953125,
        504.3516540527344,
        221.0919189453125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "technique that balances alignment with prompts and text diversity. Specifically, unsupervised CFG",
      "bbox": [
        108.0,
        223.0943603515625,
        503.9989318847656,
        232.00091552734375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "employs the following modified mask predictor for inference:",
      "bbox": [
        108.0,
        234.00433349609375,
        353.63775634765625,
        242.910888671875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
