        365.09490966796875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "pre-training and supervised fine-tuning algorithms in Algorithm 1 and Algorithm 2, respectively.",
      "bbox": [
        108.0,
        367.09735107421875,
        505.7450866699219,
        376.00390625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In addition, the likelihood evaluation algorithm is provided in Algorithm 3. Finally, we present",
      "bbox": [
        108.0,
        378.00634765625,
        503.9974060058594,
        386.91290283203125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
