      "bbox": [
        108.0,
        617.9933471679688,
        505.74407958984375,
        626.89990234375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Notably, the padding |EOS| tokens are treated as part of the response, i.e., masked and included in",
      "bbox": [
        108.0,
        628.18505859375,
        504.0001220703125,
        637.8088989257812
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the training objective. The |EOS| tokens are removed from the generated outputs during sampling.",
      "bbox": [
        108.0,
        639.0940551757812,
        505.7435607910156,
        648.7178955078125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "This strategy ensures that the model learns to control the length of its responses by generating |EOS|,",
      "bbox": [
